@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001
@serviceToken = replace-with-a-random-internal-token
@requestId = example-request-001
@appUserId = example-user-001

### 存活检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health/live

### 就绪检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health/ready

### 提交方案生成任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}
X-App-User-ID: {{appUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "generate-plan",
  "input": {
    "mode": "model",
    "brief": {
      "title": "秋季新老生交流会",
      "type": "迎新见面",
      "objective": "帮助新老同学认识彼此并交流学习经验",
      "date": "2026-10-18",
      "startTime": "11:30",
      "endTime": "13:30",
      "attendees": 30,
      "budgetMin": 1000,
      "budgetMax": 1800,
      "location": "校内餐厅",
      "venueType": "室内",
      "teamMembers": [],
      "mustHave": "共进午餐、自由交流、合影",
      "constraints": "校内单点活动"
    }
  }
}

### 查询任务；将 job-id 替换为提交接口返回的 id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/job-id
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
X-Request-ID: example-request-002
X-App-User-ID: {{appUserId}}
